---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/page.njk",
  "title": "Practical Supply Chain Planning | See your stock weeks ahead",
  "description": "Practical tools and plain-English guides from a working supply chain planner. Plan your stock week by week against your forecast, incoming orders and supplier lead times.",
  "ogTitle": "See your stock weeks ahead. No surprises.",
  "ogDescription": "Planning tools and guides for product businesses with long supplier lead times, built by a working supply chain planner.",
  "canonical": "https://practicalsupplychainplanning.com/",
  "nav": "home",
  "permalink": "/"
}
---
{%- set photo = home.photoUrl | publicAsset -%}
{%- set photoWebp = home.photoWebpUrl | publicAsset -%}
{%- set linkedin = home.linkedinUrl | publicAsset -%}
{%- set heroChart = home.heroChartUrl | publicAsset -%}
{%- set simulatorChart = home.simulatorChartUrl | publicAsset -%}
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="home-hero__copy">
    <h1 class="page-title">See your stock weeks ahead. No surprises.</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Practical planning tools and plain-English guides from a working supply chain planner.</p>
    <div class="home-actions">
      <a class="home-button" href="#tools">Explore the tools</a>
      <a class="home-button home-button--secondary" href="/learn/">Start learning</a>
    </div>
    <p class="home-byline">
      {%- if photo %}
      <picture>
        {%- if photoWebp %}
        <source srcset="{{ photoWebp }}" type="image/webp" />
        {%- endif %}
        <img
          class="home-byline__photo"
          src="{{ photo }}"
          alt="{{ home.photoAlt }}"
          width="64"
          height="64"
        />
      </picture>
      {%- endif %}
      <span>
        Built by Daniel Hampton, a working supply chain planner.
        {%- if linkedin %}
        <a href="{{ linkedin }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="home-hero__visual">
    {%- if heroChart %}
    <img
      class="home-hero__shot"
      src="{{ heroChart }}"
      alt="{{ home.heroChartAlt }}"
      width="1200"
      height="630"
    />
    {%- else %}
    {% include "partials/hero-sketch.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="card" id="why-plan-ahead" aria-labelledby="why-plan-ahead-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="why-plan-ahead-heading">Why plan ahead?</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Most small businesses reorder when stock drops to a set level. That only tells you what to do today.</p>
    <ul class="home-points">
      <li><strong>It reacts too late.</strong> With long supplier lead times, by the time stock hits the line, the shortage is already on its way.</li>
      <li><strong>It misses what's ahead.</strong> Seasonal peaks, promotions and big customer orders don't show up in a fixed level.</li>
      <li><strong>It can't see what's coming in.</strong> Orders already on their way get ignored, so you order too much or too early.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Time-phased planning looks ahead instead. It projects your stock week by week from your forecast, open orders and supplier lead times, shows when you'll run short, and plans orders to arrive in time.</p>
  </div>
  {%- if heroChart %}
  <figure class="home-chart">
    <img src="{{ heroChart }}" alt="{{ home.heroChartAlt }}" width="1200" height="630" />
  </figure>
  {%- endif %}
</section>

<section class="card" id="tools" aria-labelledby="home-tools-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="home-tools-heading">Tools to plan ahead</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Start free, then plan your whole range when you're ready.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="home-group">Learn by doing</p>
  <ul class="learn-list">
    {%- for tool in learnTools %}
    {%- if tool.title == "Safety Stock Simulator" %}
    <li class="learn-list__item">
      <a class="learn-card" href="{{ tool.href }}">
        <p class="home-label">Free</p>
        <h3 class="learn-card__title">Safety Stock Simulator</h3>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">Confused by safety stock? Explore how demand swings and supplier lead times change the buffer you need.</p>
        {%- if simulatorChart %}
        <img class="home-card__shot" src="{{ simulatorChart }}" alt="{{ home.simulatorChartAlt }}" width="1200" height="630" />
        {%- endif %}
        <span class="home-card__cta">Explore the simulator</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- elif tool.title == "Own-data Safety Stock Simulator" %}
    <li class="learn-list__item">
      <a class="learn-card" href="{{ tool.href }}">
        <p class="home-label">Free</p>
        <h3 class="learn-card__title">Own-data Safety Stock Simulator</h3>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">Then try the same simulator on up to 10 of your own items and get the results by email.</p>
        <span class="home-card__cta">Try it with your data</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>

  <p class="home-group">Planning apps</p>
  <ul class="learn-list">
    <li class="learn-list__item">
      {%- if paddle.checkoutOpen %}
      <a class="learn-card" href="/products/practical-stock-planner/">
        <p class="home-label">Available now</p>
        <h3 class="learn-card__title">Practical Stock Planner</h3>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">Projects your stock week by week from your stock on hand, open orders and forecast, then tells you what to order and when.</p>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">For Windows.</p>
        {%- if heroChart %}
        <img class="home-card__shot" src="{{ heroChart }}" alt="{{ home.stockChartAlt }}" width="1200" height="630" />
        {%- endif %}
        <span class="home-card__cta">Start your free trial</span>
      </a>
      {%- else %}
      <div class="learn-card">
        <p class="home-label">Launching 16 Nov</p>
        <h3 class="learn-card__title">Practical Stock Planner</h3>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">Projects your stock week by week from your stock on hand, open orders and forecast, then tells you what to order and when.</p>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">For Windows.</p>
        {%- if heroChart %}
        <img class="home-card__shot" src="{{ heroChart }}" alt="{{ home.stockChartAlt }}" width="1200" height="630" />
        {%- endif %}
        <p class="home-card__actions">
          <button type="button" class="trial-button" disabled>Available 16 Nov</button>
          <a href="#signup">Get launch updates</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </li>
    <li class="learn-list__item">
      <div class="learn-card">
        <p class="home-label">Coming soon</p>
        <h3 class="learn-card__title">Practical Demand Planner</h3>
        <p class="learn-card__summary">Builds the forecast your plan looks ahead with, judging each item by its own sales pattern.</p>
        <p class="home-card__actions">
          <a href="#signup">Get launch updates</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="home-learn-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="home-learn-heading">Learn the planning, not just the tool</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Plain-English guides, each built around one idea.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="home-reads">
    {%- for slug in [
      "reorder-point-vs-time-phased-planning-two-different-planning-questions",
      "mrp-is-more-than-a-stock-calculation-why-time-phasing-matters",
      "forecast-bias-finding-the-direction-behind-forecast-errors"
    ] %}
    {%- for post in collections.postsByDate %}
    {%- if post.fileSlug == slug %}
    <li class="home-read">
      <p class="home-read__title">{{ post.data.title }}</p>
      <a class="home-read__link" href="/blog/{{ post.fileSlug }}/" aria-label="Read {{ post.data.title }}">Read <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </li>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p class="home-more"><a href="/learn/">All guides</a> · <a href="/blog/">All articles</a></p>
</section>

<section class="card" aria-labelledby="home-about-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="home-about-heading">Built by a working planner</h2>
  <div class="home-founder">
    {%- if photo %}
    <picture>
      {%- if photoWebp %}
      <source srcset="{{ photoWebp }}" type="image/webp" />
      {%- endif %}
      <img
        class="home-portrait"
        src="{{ photo }}"
        alt="{{ home.aboutPhotoAlt }}"
        width="240"
        height="240"
      />
    </picture>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="content">
      <p>I'm Daniel Hampton. I've spent my career planning stock and supply for manufacturing, wholesale, retail and distribution businesses, and I still do it every day. Every tool here uses the same forward-planning methods I use at work, without the cost and complexity of big ERP systems.</p>
      <p class="home-more">
        <a href="/about/">More about me</a>
        {%- if linkedin %}
        · <a href="{{ linkedin }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- set kitTitle = "Stay in the loop" -%}
{%- set kitIntro = "Get practical planning articles by email, plus launch updates for Practical Stock Planner and Practical Demand Planner." -%}
{% include "partials/keep-in-touch.njk" %}
